⍝@ test3.

      )ERASE foo

∇foo;T
 'Vector Line 1'              ⍝ print value "Vector Line 1"
 T←'Assigned Vector Line 2'   ⍝ print nothing (comitted value)
 2 6⍴'MatrixLine 3'           ⍝ print 2 lines "Matrix" and "Line 3"
 T←2 6⍴'MatrixLine 4'         ⍝ print nothing (comitted value)
∇

      ⎕CR 'foo'
foo;T                                                              
 'Vector Line 1'              ⍝ print value "Vector Line 1"        
 T←'Assigned Vector Line 2'   ⍝ print nothing (comitted value)     
 2 6⍴'MatrixLine 3'           ⍝ print 2 lines "Matrix" and "Line 3"
 T←2 6⍴'MatrixLine 4'         ⍝ print nothing (comitted value)     


      T∆foo←1 5 6
      foo
foo[1] Vector Line 1
